stateDiagram-v2
  state "Starting" as Starting
  state "Published" as Published
  state "Draft" as Draft
  [*] --> Starting: a file in content/
  Starting --> Published: first read through the API
  Published --> Draft: an edit in the editor
  Draft --> Draft: autosave after 800 ms
  Draft --> Published: "Save"
  Draft --> Published: "Undo changes"
  Published --> Starting: a new demo release (a fingerprint in manifest.json changed)
  note right of Draft
    A read always returns the draft
    if there is one: the draft wins.
  end note
